    <string name="export_record_title">CoPlanly communication record</string>
    <string name="export_statement_what">This is a record of what the parents recorded and wrote to each other in CoPlanly, and when. It is not a record of what happened, and it does not say whether anything written here is true.</string>
    <string name="export_statement_messages">Messages cannot be edited or deleted by either parent once sent. A message\'s time is the sender\'s device clock.</string>
    <string name="export_statement_revisions">Every saved revision of a calendar entry is kept whole and cannot be changed afterwards. Each shows two times: when the editing parent\'s device recorded it, and when the server received it.</string>
    <string name="export_statement_limits">Entry times are the wall-clock times the parents entered, without a time zone. Expenses are shown as they stand today. Entries saved before revision history began show only their current state. Private entries and children\'s medical records are never included.</string>
